 865:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rtc.c **** *\*\            - AlarmTime   RTC_TimeStruct pointer to a RTC_TimeType structure that contains
 866:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rtc.c **** *\*\                         the time configuration information for the RTC.
