 868:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rtc.c **** *\*\                - if RTC_AM_H12 is select the value in the 0-23 range
 869:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_rtc.c **** *\*\                - if RTC_PM_H12 is select the value in the 1-12 range
